        "english_translation": "A friend is coming to my house on Sunday. So I bought a cake on Saturday and set it aside. So that my friend would not see it, I put it under the bed. On Saturday night I opened the box under the bed. I meant to eat only a little. But it was a very delicious cake. I ended up eating all of it. On Sunday morning I went to the supermarket and bought another big cake. At noon my friend came. My friend had a big box in hand. \"I bought a cake and brought it.\" Inside the box was the same cake as mine. We said nothing. On the table there are two of the same cake.",
